<title>USA: Silver King, Home Shopping, Savoy holders approve.</title>
<headline>Silver King, Home Shopping, Savoy holders approve.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>- Silver King Communications Inc said on Thursday its shareholders and Home Shopping Network Inc and Savoy Pictures Entertainment Inc shareholders voted to approve the merger of the three companies.</p>
<p>Silver King also said its shareholders voted to change the company's name to to HSN Inc.</p>
<p>Starting December 23, the combined company would trade on Nasdaq under the symbol &quot;HSNI,&quot; Silver King said.</p>
</text>
